e that would be dealt this turn.', 'Protection from blue', 'Protection from red\n{T}: Subterranean Spirit deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Protection from white\n{1}{R}: Wildfire Emissary gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Purraj of Urborg has first strike as long as it's attacking.\nWhenever a player casts a black spell, you may pay {B}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Purraj of Urborg.", "Put any number of target creature cards from your graveyard on top of your library.\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Put target artifact or enchantment on top of its owner's library.", "Put target creature card from an opponent's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.", "Put target creature on top of its owner's library. If that creature is red, you may put it on the bottom of its owner's library instead.", "Put target land on top of its owner's library.", 'Radiant Essence gets +1/+2 as long as an opponent controls a black permanent.', 'Rampage 1 (Whenever this creature becomes blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it beyond the first.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nWhenever Harbor Guardian attacks, defending player may draw a card.', "Return Cycle of Life to its owner's hand: Target creature you cast this turn has base power and toughness 0/1 until your next upkeep. At the beginning of your next upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.", "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Return the top creature card of your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature gains haste until end of turn. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Rocky Tar Pit enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}, Sacrifice Rocky Tar Pit: Search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Sacrifice Vigilant Martyr: Regenerate target creature.\n{W}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Vigilant Martyr: Counter target spell that targets an enchantment.', 'Sandstorm deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', 'Savage Twister deals X damage to each creature.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a creature card, reveal it, then shuffle and put the card on top.', 'Search your library for an artifact or enchantment card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'Search your library for an instant or sorcery card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nFlanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)", 'Sky Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U}.', "Soul Echo enters the battlefield with X echo counters on it.\nYou don't lose the game for having 0 or less life.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Soul Echo if there are no echo counters on it. Otherwise, target opponent may choose that for each 1 damage that would be dealt to you until your next upkeep, you remove an echo counter from Soul Echo instead.", "Spend only black mana on X.\nDrain Life deals X damage to any target. You gain life equal to the damage dealt, but not more life than the player's life total before the damage was dealt, the planeswalker's loyalty before the damage was dealt, or the creature's toughness.", 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', "Stalking Tiger can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Superior Numbers deals damage to target creature equal to the number of creatures you control in excess of the number of creatures target opponent controls.', "Suq'Ata Firewalker can't be the target of red spells or abilities from red sources.\n{T}: Suq'Ata Firewalker deals 1 damage to any target.", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\n{B}: Dirtwater Wraith gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Take an extra turn after this one. At the beginning of that turn's end step, you lose the game.", 'Tap all nonwhite creatures.', "Target artifact, creature, or land phases out. (While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist. It phases in before its controller untaps during their next untap step.)", 'Target creature defending player controls gets +3/+0 until end of turn. That creature can block up to two additional creatures this turn.', 'Target creature gains trample until end of turn. When that creature becomes blocked this turn, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Target creature you control gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard. Sacrifice that creature at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Target opponent discards a card at random, then discards a card.', 'Target permanent becomes the color or colors of your choice. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', 'Target player reveals their hand. For each blue instant card revealed this way, that player discards that card unless they pay 4 life.', 'Target player untaps all basic lands they control.', "The next time a source of your choice would deal damage this turn, that damage is dealt to that source's controller instead.", 'The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you and/or creatures you control this turn, prevent that damage. If damage from a black source is prevented this way, you gain that much life.', 'This spell costs 3 life more to cast for each target.\nDestroy any number of target creatures.', 'Torrent of Lava deals X damage to each creature without flying.\nAs long as Torrent of Lava is on the stack, each creature has "{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to this creature by Torrent of Lava this turn."', 'Trample', "Trample\nPhasing (This phases in or out before you untap during each of your untap steps. While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, all lands you control phase out. (They phase in before you untap during your next untap step.)", 'Trample\nWhen Phyrexian Dreadnought enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice any number of creatures with total power 12 or greater.', 'Trample\n{1}{G}: Canopy Dragon gains flying and loses trample until end of turn.', "Trample; banding (Any creatures with banding, and up to one without, can attack in a band. Bands are blocked as a group. If any creatures with banding you control are blocking or being blocked by a creature, you divide that creature's combat damage, not its controller, among any of the creatures it's being blocked by or is blocking.)", 'Tropical Storm deals X damage to each creature with flying and 1 additional damage to each blue creature.', "Uktabi Wildcats's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests you control.\n{G}, Sacrifice a Forest: Regenerate Uktabi Wildcats.", 'Untap target creature an opponent controls and gain control of it until end of turn. That creature gains haste until end of turn. When you lose control of the creature, tap it.', 'Untap target nonattacking creature. It gets +1/+3 until end of turn.', 'Unyaro Bee Sting deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Volcanic Geyser deals X damage to any target.', 'When Auspicious Ancestor dies, you gain 3 life.\nWhenever a player casts a white spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'When Bazaar of Wonders enters the battlefield, exile all graveyards.\nWhenever a player casts a spell, counter it if a card with the same name is in a graveyard or a nontoken permanent with the same name is on the battlefield.', "When Mangara's Tome enters the battlefield, search your library for five cards, exile them in a face-down pile, and shuffle that pile. Then shuffle your library.\n{2}: The next time you would draw a card this turn, instead put the top card of the exiled pile into its owner's hand.", 'When Merfolk Seer dies, you may pay {1}{U}. If you do, draw a card.', 'When a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Sand Golem, return Sand Golem from your graveyard to the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Whenever Brushwagg blocks or becomes blocked, it gets -2/+2 until end of turn.', "Whenever Coral Fighters attacks and isn't blocked, look at the top card of defending player's library. You may put that card on the bottom of that player's library.", "Whenever Crypt Cobra attacks and isn't blocked, defending player gets a poison counter. (A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game.)", 'Whenever Dread Specter blocks or becomes blocked by a nonblack creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', "Whenever Dream Fighter blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Dream Fighter and that creature phase out. (While they're phased out, they're treated as though they don't exist. Each one phases in before its controller untaps during their next untap step.)", 'Whenever Goblin Elite Infantry blocks or becomes blocked, it gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Jungle Wurm becomes blocked, it gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it beyond the first.', "Whenever Kukemssa Pirates attacks and isn't blocked, you may gain control of target artifact defending player controls. If you do, Kukemssa Pirates assigns no combat damage this turn.", "Whenever Lead Golem attacks, it doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Whenever Mtenda Lion attacks, defending player may pay {U}. If that player does, prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by Mtenda Lion this turn.', 'Whenever Rock Basilisk blocks or becomes blocked by a non-Wall creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Sabertooth Cobra deals damage to a player, that player gets a poison counter. The player gets another poison counter at the beginning of their next upkeep unless they pay {2} before that step. (A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game.)', 'Whenever Zebra Unicorn deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Whenever a creature attacks you, it loses flanking until end of turn.\nWhenever a creature without flying attacks you, Barbed Foliage deals 1 damage to it.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, exile that card.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may pay {4} and 2 life. If you do, return a card exiled with Purgatory to the battlefield.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell that targets you or a creature you control, you may draw a card.', "You gain 5 life.\nWhen a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Mangara's Blessing, you gain 2 life, and you return Mangara's Blessing from your graveyard to your hand at the beginning of the next end step.", 'You gain X plus 3 life.', "You may cast Armor of Thorns as though it had flash. If you cast it any time a sorcery couldn't have been cast, the controller of the permanent it becomes sacrifices it at the beginning of the next cleanup step.\nEnchant nonblack creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.", "You may cast Grave Servitude as though it had flash. If you cast it any time a sorcery couldn't have been cast, the controller of the permanent it becomes sacrifices it at the beginning of the next cleanup step.\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/-1 and is black.", "You may cast Lightning Reflexes as though it had flash. If you cast it any time a sorcery couldn't have been cast, the controller of the permanent it becomes sacrifices it at the beginning of the next cleanup step.\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has first strike.", "You may cast Soar as though it had flash. If you cast it any time a sorcery couldn't have been cast, the controller of the permanent it becomes sacrifices it at the beginning of the next cleanup step.\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+1 and has flying.", "You may cast Ward of Lights as though it had flash. If you cast it any time a sorcery couldn't have been cast, the controller of the permanent it becomes sacrifices it at the beginning of the next cleanup step.\nEnchant creature\nAs Ward of Lights enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nEnchanted creature has protection from the chosen color. This effect doesn't remove Ward of Lights.", "You may choose not to untap Amber Prison during your untap step.\n{4}, {T}: Tap target artifact, creature, or land. That permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as Amber Prison remains tapped.", 'You may choose not to untap Hivis of the Scale during your untap step.\n{T}: Gain control of target Dragon for as long as you control Hivis and Hivis remains tapped.', 'You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. If you do, sacrifice it unless you pay its mana cost reduced by up to {2}.', "You may tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Zombie Mob enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each creature card in your graveyard.\nWhen Zombie Mob enters the battlefield, exile all creature cards from your graveyard.', "{0}: Mist Dragon gains flying. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)\n{0}: Mist Dragon loses flying. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)\n{3}{U}{U}: Mist Dragon phases out. (While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist. It phases in before you untap during your next untap step.)", '{1}, Pay 1 life: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{1}, Sacrifice a creature: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to any target this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}{G}, {T}: Create a 0/1 green Wall creature token with defender named Wood.\nSacrifice a token named Wood: Add {R}.', '{1}{R}: Reckless Embermage deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to itself.', '{1}{R}{R}, {T}: Search your library for a Dragon permanent card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle. That Dragon gains haste until end of turn. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.', '{1}{R}{R}: Burning Palm Efreet deals 2 damage to target creature with flying and that creature loses flying until end of turn.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Grinning Totem: Search target opponent's library for a card and exile it. Then that player shuffles. Until the beginning of your next upkeep, you may play that card. At the beginning of your next upkeep, if you haven't played it, put it into its owner's graveyard.", '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', "{2}, {T}: Telim'Tor's Darts deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.", '{2}, {T}: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage. Exile cards from the top of your library equal to the damage prevented this way.', '{2}, {T}: Until end of turn, target creature you control gains flying and has base toughness 1.', '{2}: Igneous Golem gains trample until end of turn.', '{2}: Raging Spirit becomes colorless until end of turn.', '{2}{R}, {T}: Destroy target nonbasic land.', "{3}, {T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Unerring Sling deals damage equal to the tapped creature's power to target attacking or blocking creature with flying.", '{3}: Patagia Golem gains flying until end of turn.', '{4}, {T}: Whenever target creature deals combat damage to a non-Wall creature this turn, destroy that non-Wall creature. When the targeted creature leaves the battlefield this turn, sacrifice Acidic Dagger. Activate only before blockers are declared.', '{4}: Sawback Manticore gains flying until end of turn.\n{1}: Sawback Manticore deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature. Activate only if Sawback Manticore is attacking or blocking and only once each turn.', '{5}, {T}, Exile Amulet of Unmaking: Exile target artifact, creature, or land. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{B}, Pay 1 life: Sewer Rats gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate no more than three times each turn.', '{B}, Sacrifice Urborg Panther: Destroy target creature blocking Urborg Panther.\nSacrifice a creature named Feral Shadow, a creature named Breathstealer, and Urborg Panther: Search your library for a card named Spirit of the Night, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{B}, Sacrifice a Swamp: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mire Shade. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{B}, {T}: Tap target creature. Abyssal Hunter deals damage equal to Abyssal Hunter's power to that creature.", '{B}, {T}: Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\n{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Breathstealer gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Fetid Horror gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Regenerate Restless Dead.', '{B}: Target green creature blocking Barbed-Back Wurm gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "{B}{R}, {T}: Shauku's Minion deals 2 damage to target white creature.", '{G}, Sacrifice a Forest: Foratog gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a Forest: Regenerate target creature.', "{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn.\n{U}, {T}: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.", '{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Flame Elemental: It deals damage equal to its power to target creature.', '{R}, {T}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Red creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{R}, {T}: Destroy target artifact. That artifact deals damage equal to its mana value to Goblin Tinkerer.', '{R}, {T}: Granger Guildmage deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to you.\n{W}, {T}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', '{R}: Pyric Salamander gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Sacrifice Pyric Salamander at the beginning of the next end step.', '{R}: Regenerate Jungle Troll.\n{G}: Regenerate Jungle Troll.', '{T}, Sacrifice Daring Apprentice: Counter target spell.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Swamp: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add {U}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Crystal Vein: Add {C}{C}.', "{T}: Destroy target attacking or blocking Dragon. It can't be regenerated. You gain life equal to its power.", '{T}: Femeref Archers deals 4 damage to target attacking creature with flying.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', "{T}: Target creature with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Target spell becomes colorless.\n{T}: Target permanent becomes colorless until end of turn.', '{U}, {T}, Sacrifice Wave Elemental: Tap up to three target creatures without flying.', "{U}, {T}: Put target creature you control on top of its owner's library.\n{R}, {T}: Shadow Guildmage deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to you.", '{W}, {T}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.\n{B}, {T}: Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{X}{1}, {T}: Put X charge counters on Ventifact Bottle. Activate only as a sorcery.\nAt the beginning of your precombat main phase, if Ventifact Bottle has a charge counter on it, tap it and remove all charge counters from it. Add {C} for each charge counter removed this way.']
